---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<img src="https://i.ibb.co/Z9jGpW6/23324.png" alt="Consider it done" class="center-block"/>
			<p>
			<img src="https://i.ibb.co/G4ySB2kF/2324.png" alt="With a service that takes care of things for you, so you can focus on what matters." class="center-block" />
			</p>
<div class="media">
  <img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2032590748965621760/STixisBq_400x400.jpg" alt="">
  <div>
    <h2>About me!</h2>
    <p>Hello! I’m Zoe, I started this business because I love to help people. From little things like grocery and food orders, to things like projects of all sorts. I want to do it all.

My services and myself are here to fit your needs, I want to make your life easier, and I want you to be able to save your time, and gas for other more important things.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p></p>
<p></p>

 <h2>From everyday errands to</h2>
<h2>projects you need a hand with.</h2>
<div class="media2">
<ul>
<li>Grocery Shopping</li>
<li>Food Deliveries</li>
<li>Laundry</li>
<li>Gardening</li>
<li>Pet transportation</li>
<li>Dog nail trims</li>
<li>Moving trash bins from/to the street</li>
</ul>
  <div>
    <img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2032590748965621760/STixisBq_400x400.jpg" height:"600px" width:"600px" alt="">
  </div>
</div>
<div align="center"><h2>Rates</h2></div>

<div class="row">
  <div><h4>Need groceries?</h4><h5>Cost of groceries + $25</h5><h5>A week or bi-weekly</h5></div>
  <div><h4>Does your pet go to the groomers?</h4><h5>$12 a drive</h5></div>
</div>

<div class="row">
  <div><h4>Is your garden in need of</h4><h4>weeding or other basic maintenance?</h4><h5>$15-$25 an hour</h5><h5>Depending on workload</h5></div>
  <div><h4How about help with packing or loading boxes up?</h4><h5>$20 an hour</h5></div>
</div>
	
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
</html>
